### Status (health + which model is configured)
GET http://localhost:9080/report/api/status
Accept: application/json
###

### Generic Hourglass mapping (the template's challenge endpoint)
POST http://localhost:9080/report/api/hourglass/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "domain": "connected car-sharing fleet",
  "useCase": "Analyse driving sessions to score safety and eco efficiency"
}
###

### Ingest a finished trip (what the fleet server posts; no LLM)
POST http://localhost:9080/report/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tripId": "demo0001",
  "endedAt": 1782846925.25,
  "driver": { "did": "DRV-01", "name": "Marco", "surname": "Rossi",
              "cf": "RSSMRC00X12Y34Z", "nationality": "Italia" },
  "vehicle": { "vid": "AB123CD", "odo_km": 42000.0, "fuel_pct": 61.0,
               "oil_pct": 88.0, "lights": [] },
  "session": {
    "vid": "AB123CD", "dist_km": 0.333, "dur_min": 0.27, "avg_kmh": 75.0,
    "max_kmh": 108.6, "avg_rpm": 2592, "fuel_l": 0.022, "l_per_100km": 6.6,
    "harsh_accel": 2, "harsh_brake": 0, "overrev_s": 0.0, "cold_overrev_s": 0.0,
    "idle_s": 0.0, "speeding_s": 12.0
  },
  "scores": { "safety": 64.0, "eco": 73.6 },
  "flags": ["harsh_accel", "speeding"]
}
###

### Who is driving now (live, pushed by the fleet server)
GET http://localhost:9080/report/api/active
Accept: application/json
###

### Vehicle registry
GET http://localhost:9080/report/api/vehicles
Accept: application/json
###

### Driver registry
GET http://localhost:9080/report/api/drivers
Accept: application/json
###

### Generate (or return cached) a driver's report
POST http://localhost:9080/report/api/drivers/DRV-01/report
Accept: application/json
###

### History of generated reports
GET http://localhost:9080/report/api/report
Accept: application/json
###
